  "description": "The social outcast, Seria, had changed. \n\nSeria Shuteren, the vile woman who had everyone trembling with fear at her feet, was now calm. Truthfully, the woman had not just changed; she was a completely different person. Realizing she had possessed the wicked woman's body in this romance novel, she decided to live on the low, having a hunch about the future. \n\nShe would end Seria's dreadful habits and successfully avoid her death by decapitation at the hands of Kalis, the sub male lead!",
